```{=html}

<div class="list grid">

    <% for (const item of items) { %>

        <div class="card g-col-12 g-col-sm-6 g-col-md-3 bg-light" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
            <% if(item.image){ %>
                <a href="<%- item.link %>">
                    <img src="<%- item.image %>"
                    class="card-img-top img-fluid rounded-start" alt="<%- item.name %> first page">
                </a>
            <% } %>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title listing-title"><a href="<%- item.link %>"><%- item.name %></a></h5>
                        <% if(item.badges){ %>
                            <% for (const badge of item.badges) { %>
                                <span class="badge rounded-pill bg-dark"><%- badge %></span>
                            <% } %>
                        <% } %>
                    <p class="card-text"><small class="text-muted">
                        <%= item.description %>
                    </small></p>
                </div>
        </div>

    <% } %>

</div>
```
